{"platform": "facebook", "post_id": "1035071751957724", "input_url": "https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=1035071751957724&id=100063647256368", "canonical_url": "https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=1035071751957724&id=100063647256368", "author": {"name": "McDonald's (Argos, IN)", "profile_url": "https://www.facebook.com/McDonalds10450StateHwy10"}, "content": "The McDonald’s and Genshin Impact video game collaboration has started!\nExclusive in-game rewards are available with limited-edition McDonald’s menu items, available only through the McDonald’s app.\nGrab the Genshin Impact Apple Pie or the Genshin Impact Deluxe McCrispy Meal to unlock exclusive in-game items. Have fun!", "publish_time": "2024-09-20", "like_count": null, "share_count": null, "comment_count": 0, "comments": [], "collected_at": "2026-06-15T07:32:51Z", "collection_status": "success", "extraction_source": "dom", "error": null, "publish_time_text": "September 20, 2024", "input_metadata": {"label": "mcdonalds_genshin", "original_url": "https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=1035071751957724&id=100063647256368"}, "batch_input_url": "https://www.facebook.com/story.php?story_fbid=1035071751957724&id=100063647256368", "diagnostics_path": "output\\debug\\facebook_batch\\0002_1035071751957724_diagnostics.json", "html_path": "output\\debug\\facebook_batch\\0002_1035071751957724_page.html", "screenshot_path": "output\\debug\\facebook_batch\\0002_1035071751957724_page.png"}
{"platform": "facebook", "post_id": "pfbid0c9s5BtbDn7tvdtb6aCwf6ezGz7dnNdcuV7aeFEL1sReyoUbHVwqg83iRooSq1yddl", "input_url": "https://www.facebook.com/char.wright.160890/posts/pfbid0c9s5BtbDn7tvdtb6aCwf6ezGz7dnNdcuV7aeFEL1sReyoUbHVwqg83iRooSq1yddl", "canonical_url": "https://www.facebook.com/char.wright.160890/posts/pfbid0c9s5BtbDn7tvdtb6aCwf6ezGz7dnNdcuV7aeFEL1sReyoUbHVwqg83iRooSq1yddl", "author": {"name": "Char Wright", "profile_url": "https://www.facebook.com/char.wright.160890"}, "content": "Talking about games irl can be super awkward sometimes.\nLike yesterday my cousin ask me what games I played and it felt kinda uncomfortable. He's one of those ball and gun gamers who only play 2K, Call of Duty, and Apex. So I don't even know if he knows what an RPG is. And saying \"I play RPGs\" usually gets me a \"what is that\" response, and I struggle a lot to explain what it is.\nFrom personal experience, even people that know the genre only recognize Final Fantasy, Chrono Trigger and maybe Super Mario RPG or Secert of Mana. So it's difficult to name a bunch of stuff without people having no idea what you're talking about haha.", "publish_time": null, "like_count": 13, "share_count": 1, "comment_count": 6, "comments": [], "collected_at": "2026-06-15T07:33:26Z", "collection_status": "success", "extraction_source": "dom", "error": null, "publish_time_text": "4h", "input_metadata": {"label": "char_wright_rpg", "original_url": "https://www.facebook.com/char.wright.160890/posts/pfbid0c9s5BtbDn7tvdtb6aCwf6ezGz7dnNdcuV7aeFEL1sReyoUbHVwqg83iRooSq1yddl"}, "batch_input_url": "https://www.facebook.com/char.wright.160890/posts/pfbid0c9s5BtbDn7tvdtb6aCwf6ezGz7dnNdcuV7aeFEL1sReyoUbHVwqg83iRooSq1yddl", "diagnostics_path": "output\\debug\\facebook_batch\\0003_pfbid0c9s5BtbDn7tvdtb6aCwf6ezGz7dnNdcuV7aeFEL1sReyoUbHVwqg83iRooSq1yddl_diagnostics.json", "html_path": "output\\debug\\facebook_batch\\0003_pfbid0c9s5BtbDn7tvdtb6aCwf6ezGz7dnNdcuV7aeFEL1sReyoUbHVwqg83iRooSq1yddl_page.html", "scree